  "song": {
    "name": "Ornament Demo",
    "author": "",
    "description": "Ornament Demo — a teaching project for the Note Processors per-note ornament feature. Five 2-bar snare phrases, one per ornament type (Flam / Drag / Ruff / Roll / Grace), played in sequence over a steady four-on-the-floor kick at 100 BPM. Each ornament expands a single snare hit into its characteristic figure at playback; toggle \"Ghosts\" in the piano roll to see the generated hits, or read each pattern's description for the exact settings. Loop covers the whole demo (beats 0–40). Built via MCP.",
